meta {
  name: 01_AdministratorLifecycle
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: A bostyrer adds an assistant as administrator and revokes the role again

    Given the assistant is not an administrator for the bostyrer
    And the bostyrer holds bankruptcy estates
    When the bostyrer adds the assistant by SSN and last name
    Then the assistant is listed as administrator with access to the estates
    And the assistant holds the three estate packages from an estate
    And adding the assistant again returns the same assignment
    And the assistant is listed only once
    When the bostyrer revokes the assistant
    Then the assistant is no longer listed
    And the assistant no longer holds the estate packages
    And revoking again succeeds without change
}
